cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "nullbar: pre-registration and honest statistics for trading research"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pereira
    given-names: Bruno
repository-code: "https://github.com/brunopereira81/nullbar"
license: MIT
version: 0.5.0
date-released: "2026-08-18"
keywords:
  - backtesting
  - overfitting
  - deflated-sharpe
  - pre-registration
  - lookahead-bias
  - quantitative-finance
abstract: >-
  A small library for measurement honesty in trading research: frozen
  pre-registrations with a single enforced test look, an append-only trial
  ledger, per-period PSR/DSR, block-clustered inference, null controls graded
  against a hold baseline, touch/through fill brackets, and a prefix-replay
  check that detects lookahead leakage in any feature function.
